# The television's own account runs anything as root, with no password.
#
# Chosen deliberately: the Terminal tile, and ssh with a key, are how fixes get
# made on a television nobody logs into, and the account has no password to
# type. The cost is real and stated in docs/TERMINAL.md: anything that runs as
# this account, a bug in a service it runs or someone with a keyboard, can
# become root. Delete this file to take the rights away.
tv ALL=(ALL) NOPASSWD: ALL
